# .gitignore for Mima.AI.Prompt
# Why: keeps build artifacts, secrets, IDE noise, and local-only files out of git
# so the public history stays clean and cloneable for open-source contributors.

## Build outputs
# Why: compiled binaries and intermediate files are machine-generated and
# reproduce from source via `dotnet build`. Committing them bloats the repo.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
artifacts/
publish/
out/
TestResults/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.ilk
*.meta
*.obj
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.pgc
*.pgd
*.rsp
*.sbr
*.tlb
*.tli
*.tlh
*.tmp
*.tmp_proj
*.log
*.vspscc
*.vssscc
.builds
*.pidb
*.svclog
*.scc

## NuGet
# Why: packages are restored from nuget.org; committing them duplicates
# megabytes of vendor code and causes restore conflicts across machines.
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

## Coverage / test reports
# Why: coverage HTML/JSON is regenerated by CI (`coverlet`); local reports
# differ per run and should not pollute PRs.
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.cobertura.xml
*.opencover.xml
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coveragereport/
CoverageReport/

## Local code review artifact
# Why: CODE_REVIEW.md is a maintainer-local strict review dump, not a
# community-facing document. Track findings in Issues/PRs instead.
CODE_REVIEW.md

## Working planning docs
# Why: TEMP.md is an ephemeral implementation plan; promote finished work
# into CHANGELOG/Issues and remove this file when done.
TEMP.md

## IDE / editor
# Why: personal IDE settings (Rider, VS, VS Code workspace state) vary
# per developer; sharing them causes merge noise. Shared rules live in
# .editorconfig / .vscode recommendations instead.
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
.idea/
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

## OS junk
# Why: Finder/Explorer metadata is not source and breaks cross-platform diffs.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Secrets & local config
# Why: API keys, tokens, and machine-specific config must never be published.
# Open-source repos are scraped for leaked credentials constantly.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pfx
*.snk
secrets.json
appsettings.*.local.json
local.settings.json

## Benchmark / profiling
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

## DocFX / docs site output
_site/
api/
obj/docfx/

## Cursor / agent local state (optional)
.cursor/
!.cursor/rules/
